stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> created : PaymentIntent created
    created --> authorized : card authorized
    created --> failed : declined or 3DS failed
    authorized --> captured : captured
    authorized --> voided : voided or auth expired
    captured --> partially_refunded : partial refund
    partially_refunded --> partially_refunded : another partial refund
    partially_refunded --> refunded : rest refunded
    captured --> refunded : full refund
    captured --> disputed : customer disputes
    disputed --> captured : dispute won
    disputed --> chargeback : dispute lost
    failed --> [*]
    voided --> [*]
    refunded --> [*]
    chargeback --> [*]